//
// Ops (applied in order):
//   {money:n}            gain (n>0) or pay (n<0) money; paying requires enough money
//   {hp:n}               heal (n>0, capped) or lose (n<0; requires hp > loss)
//   {healPct:p}          heal ceil(maxHp*p), capped
